Package: libkrun-init0
Source: libkrun
Version: 2.0.0~dev1-1
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Aria Stewart <aredridel@dinhe.net>
Installed-Size: 2604
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.34), libgcc-s1 (>= 4.2)
Section: libs
Priority: optional
Multi-Arch: same
Homepage: https://github.com/libkrun/libkrun
Description: Guest init configuration library for libkrun
 Host-side library that builds the configuration a libkrun guest needs and
 injects it, together with the PID 1 binary it embeds, into the guest
 filesystem overlay. It also converts OCI container specifications into guest
 initialization structures.
